    <title>autofac/Autofac - Releases - 2025-08-04</title>
    <id>https://github.com/autofac/Autofac#2025-08-04</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac" />
    <updated>2025-08-05T00:08:07Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac/releases/tag/v8.4.0"&gt;v8.4.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minor breaking change&lt;/strong&gt;: The shim &lt;code&gt;RequiresUnreferencedCodeAttribute&lt;/code&gt; has been changed from &lt;code&gt;public&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;internal&lt;/code&gt; (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3283244818" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac/issues/1462" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/autofac/Autofac/issues/1462/hovercard" href="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac/issues/1462"&gt;#1462&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3284219797" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac/issues/1463" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/autofac/Autofac/pull/1463/hovercard" href="https://github.com/autofac/Autofac/pull/1463"&gt;#1463&lt;/a&gt; - thanks &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/prochnowc/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/prochnowc"&gt;@prochnowc&lt;/a&gt;!). This will only affect people targeting older/lower .NET standard frameworks who &lt;em&gt;also&lt;/em&gt; rely on the shim attribute in Autofac. While it's &lt;em&gt;technically&lt;/em&gt; breaking, it didn't seem like a great reason to do a full major release due to the edge case nature of the set of applications/users affected.&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
